cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "FC300 — Black Fictional Characters Registry"
version: 1.0
date-released: 2026-11-16
abstract: "300 Black fictional characters across seven mediums (Television 70, Film 60, Comics & Superheroes 50, Animation 40, Literature & Books 40, Video Games 25, Theater & Stage 15), each with creator, first appearance, portrayer, coverage status, citation, and a full AEO layer. Only 139 characters have a Wikidata item of their own; 157 (52%) exist solely inside their franchise's page. Coverage Status is the dataset's evidence vocabulary, kept verbatim. Images are link-only by design — the dataset distributes metadata and citations, never image files."
authors:
  - name: "CultureTechLens NFP"
license: CC-BY-4.0
